## 📋 Prerequisites

Make sure your development environment is set up correctly:

```bash
flugo doctor
```

## ⚡ Quick Start

Generate the bridge code and run the app:

```bash
flugo generate
flugo run
```

## 📁 Project Structure

```
{{.Name}}/
├── backend/          # Go backend
│   ├── bridge/       # Auto-generated bridge code (do not edit)
│   ├── main.go       # Entry point
│   └── service.go    # Backend services
├── frontend/         # Flutter frontend
│   ├── lib/
│   │   ├── app/      # App UI code
│   │   └── bridge/   # Auto-generated bridge code (do not edit)
│   └── pubspec.yaml
├── assets/           # Icons, packaging files
├── flugo.yaml        # Flugo project config
└── Makefile          # Build helpers
```

## 🛠️ Common Commands

| Command | Description |
|---|---|
| `flugo generate` | Generate bridge code from Go services |
| `flugo run` | Run the app in development mode |
| `flugo build linux` | Build for Linux |
| `flugo build macos` | Build for macOS |
| `flugo build windows` | Build for Windows |
| `flugo clean` | Clean build artifacts |
| `flugo doctor` | Check development environment |

